---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import ButtonLink from '../../components/ButtonLink.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Solutions" description="Full-service payroll, online payroll, direct deposit, PayCard, timekeeping, and scheduling solutions.">
	<PageHero title="Streamline Your Payroll with Our Full-Service Solution" subtitle="Simple payroll management with support built for busy business owners." />
	<section class="section">
		<div class="container centered">
			<p>Reporting payroll, distributing checks, or offering hassle-free direct deposit on payday has never been easier.</p>
            <p>Once you submit your payroll information, your responsibilities are done—<span class="bold-text">we handle the rest!</span></p>
            <p>Experience stress-free payroll management that saves you time and ensures accuracy every step of the way.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="section">
		<div class="container feature-grid">
			<div class="feature"><h3>Payments</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Paychecks or direct deposit stubs with each payroll</li>
                    <li>Privacy envelopes for distribution of paychecks or direct deposit stubs</li>
                    <li>Garnishment calculations</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="feature"><h3>Tracking</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Comprehensive payroll reports</li>
                    <li>General ledger reporting</li>
                    <li>An easy to complete payroll worksheet for the next payroll</li>
                    <li>Paid time off accrual</li>
                    <li>Year end reporting</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
			<div class="feature"><h3>Compliance</h3><ul>
                    <li>Automation of tax payments and reporting</li>
                    <li>Annual W-2s</li>
                    <li>Correspondence with government agencies on your behalf if necessary</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
		</div>
	</section>
    <section class="section section--gray section--green-point">
        <div class="container centered">
            <h2>Online Payroll</h2>
            <p>Online payroll gives our clients the option to submit and view payroll from any location. Employees can also log on to view and print their past pay history. We want to save you time and money and Online Payroll is a great way to do that.</p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section">
        <div class="container feature-grid">
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>24 HOUR ACCESS</h3>
                <p>24 hour access to all of your payroll information from any location</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>EASILY MAKE CHANGES</h3>
                <p>Add/change employee set-up information</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>PAYROLL REPORTS</h3>
                <p>View and print payroll reports</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <h3>PAY STUBS</h3>
                <p>View and print employee pay stubs</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="container centered">
            <p>And Integrated Payroll continues to manage:</p>
        </div>
        <div class="container split">
            <ul>
                <li>General ledger reporting</li>
                <li>Garnishment calculations</li>
                <li>Paid time off accrual</li>
            </ul>
            <ul>
                <li>Automation of Tax Payments and Reporting</li>
                <li>Annual W-2s</li>
                <li>Correspondence with government agencies on your behalf if necessary</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="section section--gray">
        <div class="container centered">
            <h2>Get a quote to see if Online Payroll is a good option for you!</h2>
            <ButtonLink href="/free-quote/" text="Request a Quote" />
        </div>
    </section>
	<section class="section">
		<div class="container split">
			<div><h2>Direct Deposit or PayCard</h2><p>Save costs for your company and your employees with direct deposit or PayCard options. Printed checks are also available.</p></div>
			<div><h2>Timekeeping and Scheduling</h2><p>Minimize errors, calculate data faster, and reduce wasted labor time with automated timekeeping services.</p></div>
		</div>
		<div class="container centered"><ButtonLink href="/free-quote/" text="Request a Quote" /></div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>